Real DevOps Interview Questions in a Top MNC

Here are the exact scenarios I was asked 👇

1️⃣ Pipeline Trigger Conflict

CI was triggering on every commit instead of only when .NET project files changed.
➡️ How will you debug and fix selective triggers in YAML?

2️⃣ Multi-Stage Pipeline Failing Only in Production

Build → QA → UAT → Prod works everywhere except Prod (random timeout errors).
➡️ How will you check if it’s an agent issue, environment config, or misconfigured task?

3️⃣ Parallel Deployments Causing Locks

Two teams deploying to the same App Service caused deployment collisions.
➡️ How will you design locking, approvals, or exclusive jobs?

4️⃣ Release Pipeline Dropping Artifacts

Artifacts disappeared after retention cleanup, breaking releases.
➡️ How will you ensure artifact availability?

5️⃣ Infrastructure Drift (Azure Bicep / Terraform / CloudFormation)

Manual changes created resource drift.
➡️ How will you detect and enforce desired state?

6️⃣ Blue-Green Deployment Failure

Green slot worked, but swap failed due to warm-up issues.
➡️ What checks, health probes, and validations will you configure?

7️⃣ AKS/EKS Deployment Failing on Only One Node

Pods failed on 1 node with ImagePullBackOff.
➡️ How will you identify if it’s node-specific, registry-related, or pipeline-related?

8️⃣ Zero-Downtime Deployment for Functions/Lambda

Zip deploy caused downtime.
➡️ Will you choose slots, run-from-package, container deployment, Lambda versions/aliases… and why?

9️⃣ PAT Token Misuse

A developer accidentally committed a PAT token.
➡️ What immediate actions will you take?
➡️ How will you redesign authentication securely?
